### Get all customers
GET http://localhost:3000/customers HTTP/1.1

### Get customer by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/customers/cust001 HTTP/1.1

### Get top customers
GET http://localhost:3000/customers/top?limit=10 HTTP/1.1

### Create new customer
POST http://localhost:3000/customers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "TEST-CUST",
  "customerFirstName": "Test",
  "customerLastName": "Customer",
  "customerGender": "M",
  "customerContactNumber": "09123456789",
  "customerEmail": "testcustomer@email.com",
  "customerAddress": "123 Test St",
  "customerVisitCount": 0,
  "customerLoyaltyPoints": 0,
  "customerStatus": "ACTIVE"
}

### Update customer
PUT http://localhost:3000/customers/TEST-CUST HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerContactNumber": "09987654321",
  "customerLoyaltyPoints": 100
}

### Increment customer visit count
PUT http://localhost:3000/customers/TEST-CUST/visit HTTP/1.1

### Delete customer
DELETE http://localhost:3000/customers/TEST-CUST HTTP/1.1
